OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after motorcyclist
OL,4,Adies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,8,Fdriving after a motorcyclist died in a
OL,9,Fcrash in a village.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said a silver
OL,12,FMercedes Vito van and red Yamaha
OL,13,Fmotorcycle collided in Desford Road,
OL,14,FNewtown Unthank, shortly after 07:00
OL,15,FGMT on Friday.
OL,17,FThe 19-year-old motorcyclist was taken
OL,18,Fto hospital but died from his injuries.
OL,20,FThe driver of the van, a 43-year-old
OL,21,Fman from Leicester, is currently in
OL,22,Fpolice custody following his arrest.
